** The overcaller's side after an advance

After a single raise (7--10) the overcaller invites with 13--14 (accepted with
9--10) and bids game in a major with 15+; after the preemptive jump raise he
passes. After the cuebid (11+ with support) and the overcaller's minimum
rebid, advancer bids game in a major with 13+ and invites with 11--12
(accepted with 11+); after the overcaller's jump or 2NT, advancer bids game.
After 1NT (8--11) the overcaller bids 3NT with 16+ and invites with 14--15;
after 2NT (12--14) he bids 3NT with 11+. A non-forcing new suit is raised
with three-card support and otherwise passed.

#CUT overcaller-after-raise
4\M = {prio:2} 15+ hcp
  #STOP
3\M = {prio:1} 13--14 hcp
  (P)
    4\M = {prio:1} 9--10 hcp
      #STOP
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
  (any)
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
#ENDCUT

#CUT advancer-after-cue-min
4\M = {prio:2} 13+ hcp
  #STOP
3\M = {prio:1} 11--12 hcp
  (P)
    4\M = {prio:1} 11+ hcp
      #STOP
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
  (any)
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
#ENDCUT

#CUT overcaller-after-1n
3N = {prio:2} 16+ hcp
  #STOP
2N = {prio:1} 14--15 hcp
  (P)
    3N = {prio:1} 10--11 hcp
      #STOP
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
  (any)
    P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand
#ENDCUT

