** After a two-level overcall and after a weak jump overcall

The raise of a two-level overcall (6--11) is passed, except that 3NT is bid
with 15+ and a stopper; after the cuebid (12+) the overcaller bids 3NT with a
stopper and otherwise game in his suit. The raise of a weak jump overcall
ends the auction; after the 2NT inquiry the overcaller rebids his suit and
advancer places the contract (game in a major with 17+).

