** Other advances

A three-level jump overcall is passed unless advancer has 15+ and a stopper
(3NT); over the unusual 2NT advancer picks the longer of the two suits shown
(the higher-ranking one with equal length); a double of their 1NT is left in;
our raise of an overcall of their 1NT ends the auction, and so does opener's
signoff after our 1NT and their overcall.

