** Advances after they raise over Michaels, and of the sandwich overcall over 1NT

Phase 4 (NOTES.md #P8). When the opponents raise over our Michaels cuebid,
advancer still chooses a suit: over a minor-suit cuebid (both majors) game in a
major with 11+ and three-card support, otherwise the cheapest major with
three-card support (spades only with a doubleton or less in hearts, or four
spades and three hearts); over a major-suit cuebid game in the known major
with 11+ (8+ when that is already the four level) and, over 2!h, the cheapest
spade bid with 0--10. With no fit advancer passes. After the sandwich overcall
over their 1NT response and opener's pass, advancer raises with three-card
support and 8--11; the partnership then stops, as in `competitive-extra.bml`.

